      "writtenOn": "2021-04-28T16:42:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is api naming appropriate here? Reading Android.bp with this property doesn\u0027t really tell much to the reader.. Maybe just stub_libs if you don\u0027t plan to add more?\n\nI am not too strongly opinionated on the naming; it just feels \"very generic\" as is in this change..",
